## Domain-Driven Naming

Column and concept names must reflect the **People domain** and business meaning, not the source system or tool.

| Avoid (tool-driven) | Prefer (domain-driven) |
|---------------------|------------------------|
| `per_information_category` | `marital_status`, `rg_issuing_state` |
| `vote_registration_number` | `electoral_registration_number` |
| `polling_station` | `electoral_polling_station` |
| `issuing_state_rg` | `rg_issuing_state` |

Use terms that data consumers and HR stakeholders understand, independent of Oracle, Workday, or other source systems.

